{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01448",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 5.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Right, hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.06,
      "end_seconds": 11.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 12.79,
      "end_seconds": 26.27,
      "duration_seconds": 13.48,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. He's been having a painful band of blisters on the left side of my chest, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 27.19,
      "end_seconds": 30.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Right, what's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.5,
      "end_seconds": 33.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "about... well, three weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.09,
      "end_seconds": 42.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.43,
      "text": "Ah, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 42.62,
      "end_seconds": 47.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.61,
      "end_seconds": 62.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "I was getting to that! I've had burning pain before the rash came too, for ten days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 65.85,
      "end_seconds": 68.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Yes, exactly like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.23,
      "end_seconds": 73.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Have you had any eye pain or blurred vision?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.79,
      "end_seconds": 85.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.02,
      "text": "no, no eye pain, no blurred vision i did have a mild fever at one point, but that went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.47,
      "end_seconds": 93.64,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "Have you had any rash on the other side, immune problems or weakness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.74,
      "end_seconds": 97.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.02,
      "end_seconds": 102.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.6,
      "end_seconds": 105.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.99,
      "end_seconds": 107.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.15,
      "end_seconds": 111.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.88,
      "end_seconds": 117.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "How active are you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 118.96,
      "end_seconds": 122.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 123.4,
      "end_seconds": 126.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 127.54,
      "end_seconds": 133.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.49,
      "text": "I take gliclazide, 80 milligrams, twice a day for my sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 133.57,
      "end_seconds": 141.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "it's meant to be twice a day, though I don't see he take it every time"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.78,
      "end_seconds": 150.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.27,
      "end_seconds": 153.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.82,
      "end_seconds": 167.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.75,
      "text": "for my acidity, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.66,
      "end_seconds": 174.86,
      "duration_seconds": 5.2,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.45,
      "end_seconds": 189.38,
      "duration_seconds": 12.93,
      "text": "hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic but I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.33,
      "end_seconds": 194.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.28,
      "end_seconds": 197.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "I've got diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.29,
      "end_seconds": 200.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.36,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 201.27,
      "end_seconds": 204.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.21,
      "end_seconds": 206.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.39,
      "end_seconds": 214.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "Heart disease, for about a year. I've had acid reflux for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.02,
      "end_seconds": 216.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "And besides that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.86,
      "end_seconds": 227.2,
      "duration_seconds": 10.34,
      "text": "yes, heart disease and acid reflux are known to us, good to have that clear. Okay, any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.76,
      "end_seconds": 232.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Just part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.94,
      "end_seconds": 246.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.74,
      "end_seconds": 253.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "My sister had breast cancer. My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.53,
      "end_seconds": 260.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.23,
      "end_seconds": 274.2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.4,
      "end_seconds": 278.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I'll listen to to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.44,
      "end_seconds": 299.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.51,
      "text": "Grouped blisters on a red base along one rib on the left, not crossing the midline"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.49,
      "end_seconds": 301.19,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.42,
      "end_seconds": 312.36,
      "duration_seconds": 8.94,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. Okay, so my impression is this: This is probably shingles. I'd also keep contact dermatitis in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.99,
      "end_seconds": 315.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.53,
      "end_seconds": 348.01,
      "duration_seconds": 30.48,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's shingles, and we'll watch how it goes. For this, aciclovir, 800 milligrams, five times a day, for seven days. It's for shingles. The pharmacy will go through the details again when you pick it up. We'll begin with paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for five days. That should help with pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.36,
      "end_seconds": 350.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.52,
      "end_seconds": 372.54,
      "duration_seconds": 21.02,
      "text": "keep the blisters clean and covered, and avoid contact with anyone pregnant or newborn until they crust. The thing that would worry me is if the rash spreads to to your face or eye. If that happens, go to emergency. I'd like to see you again in two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 374.55,
      "end_seconds": 379.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.12,
      "end_seconds": 384.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.63,
      "text": "right, that's the plan do you want to ask me anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 385.47,
      "end_seconds": 388.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.79,
      "end_seconds": 392.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.45,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}